    "title": "Will Riley Traded to Washington Wizards in NBA Draft",
    "text": "Trending Story\nUpdated 04:21 AM UTC, Thu June 26, 2025\nWill Riley Traded to Washington Wizards in NBA Draft\nThe Wizards trade The Draft Rights Of Walter Clayton Jr. to the Jazz To Draft Illinois standout Will Riley and multiple second-round picks.\nJames Fletcher\n\"Will Riley is a high-powered offensive prospect, who is also one of the youngest players in the class this year.\"\nRotoWire.com\n\"Riley showed the ability to score near the rim and handle isolation plays, and his frame will help him succeed at the next level in individual duels.\"",
